    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179450/extras/33832f959aac4fff59de94bb18bb49f9.avif?t=1729757734\" width=600 height=90 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179450/extras/b44cb3b54ded8f4fed385aa7559b93ea.avif?t=1729757734\" width=666 height=66 /></span><br><br>There are rumors that the first &quot;<strong>DYGYN</strong>&quot; games were organized by the great Tygyn Darkhan himself, after the <strong>URAANHAI</strong> drove Alaa-Mogus into the underworld! In ancient times, the first &quot;<strong>DYGYN</strong>&quot; games featured the strongest warriors of the <strong>URAANHAI</strong>. And among them was YOU! Friends, are you ready to compete with the mightiest <strong>URAANHAI</strong>?<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Yakut voiceover<br><br></li><li>New funny memes, like in &quot;URANHAIDAR vs. ALAA-MOGUS&quot;<br><br></li><li>Play in multiplayer and compete with your friends in the first DYGHYNA games!<br><br></li><li>We now have a chance to see how our ancestors played firsthand<br><br></li><li>Authentic Yakut assets<br><br></li><li>Immerse yourself in a true YAKUT SUMMER. Mmm... the fresh scent of the forest...<br><br></li><li>Compete against various people or your FRIENDS and don\u2019t let them overtake you!</li></ul><br><i>So, are you ready, URANHAI? Then let's go!</i><br><br>The goal of the game is to jump, dodge, run, overcome obstacles, and try to reach the finish line first!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179450/extras/b44cb3b54ded8f4fed385aa7559b93ea.avif?t=1729757734\" width=666 height=66 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179450/extras/33832f959aac4fff59de94bb18bb49f9.avif?t=1729757734\" width=600 height=90 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179450/extras/b44cb3b54ded8f4fed385aa7559b93ea.avif?t=1729757734\" width=666 height=66 /></span><br><br>There are rumors that the first &quot;<strong>DYGYN</strong>&quot; games were organized by the great Tygyn Darkhan himself, after the <strong>URAANHAI</strong> drove Alaa-Mogus into the underworld! In ancient times, the first &quot;<strong>DYGYN</strong>&quot; games featured the strongest warriors of the <strong>URAANHAI</strong>. And among them was YOU! Friends, are you ready to compete with the mightiest <strong>URAANHAI</strong>?<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Yakut voiceover<br><br></li><li>New funny memes, like in &quot;URANHAIDAR vs. ALAA-MOGUS&quot;<br><br></li><li>Play in multiplayer and compete with your friends in the first DYGHYNA games!<br><br></li><li>We now have a chance to see how our ancestors played firsthand<br><br></li><li>Authentic Yakut assets<br><br></li><li>Immerse yourself in a true YAKUT SUMMER. Mmm... the fresh scent of the forest...<br><br></li><li>Compete against various people or your FRIENDS and don\u2019t let them overtake you!</li></ul><br><i>So, are you ready, URANHAI? Then let's go!</i><br><br>The goal of the game is to jump, dodge, run, overcome obstacles, and try to reach the finish line first!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179450/extras/b44cb3b54ded8f4fed385aa7559b93ea.avif?t=1729757734\" width=666 height=66 /></span>",
    "short_description": "URAANHAI! Finally, we have all together driven Alaa-Mogus into the underworld! Now let's have a real Ysyakh and celebrate! Let's organize the first &quot;DYGYNA&quot; game and find out who is the fastest! Play in multiplayer and become the FIRST!",
